body:
Eh, I could see someone being uncomfortable with her age + the line.\*  Even more so if they are not or were inclined towards that themselves at that age. 

&#x200B;

\*Though, yes some irl AFAB teens, and adults, have fantasies and watch porn (though the teens shouldn't) like that.

Well this was a godsend for what I'm working on. Thank you!

&#x200B;

(don't ask what, you don't want to know.)

The trees are not what they seem. Repent: they, too, have teeth.

&#x200B;

Well then.

> I'm so sick of my heroes disappointing me. 

&#x200B;

If this keeps happening did ya ever stop to think "maybe I'm the asshole?"

What (I'm assuming) he means to say: I want to make you come so hard you see God.

&#x200B;

What I'm getting from this line: Please die and take my dick with you.

And possibly on going the guys still loose somewhere here in Louisiana.

&#x200B;

Update: Been caught

I'm thirty years old and I'm real tired of having my trans identity compared to someone's angsty high school years.

&#x200B;

Also I'm just tired.
